		<br/>
        <div id="viewTable">
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
        <th  width="20%" style="text-align:center">Date</th>
        <th  width="20%" style="text-align:center">Time (HH:MM:SS)</th>
        <th  width="20%" style="text-align:center">Realtime LME </th>
        <th  width="20%" style="text-align:center">TT Selling</th>
        <th  width="20%" style="text-align:center">Realtime Price (8 mm)</th>
        
        
       		
      <tr>
    <td colspan="5" height="50"><div class="redtext" align="center"><strong>No Record Found</strong></div></td>
  </tr>
        
        
        </table>
        <br/>
        </div>
        
    <p><b>Note :</b></p>
    
    
    <p style="color:#a34500;"><b>Pricing Formula for Realtime Booking :</b></p>
    <br/>
    <p>Basic Price = [(LME + Premium) X Multiplication Factor 1.058 X TT Selling ] + Handling Charges <b>Rs.3300</b>/- PMT</p>
    <br/>
    <p>Where Premium is USD 240, 250, 260, 280, 120 and 150 for CC Rod 8mm, 11/12.5mm, 16mm, 19mm and Cathode respectively and CC Rod 8mm Non Standard is <b>Rs.400</b>/- PMT lower than CC Rod 8mm & Cathode (Cut) is <b>Rs.1500</b>/- PMT higher than Cathode (Full).</p>

        
        
    </div>
